<title>POLAND: Espebepe loss rises to PLN 34.9 mln in Q4.</title>
<headline>Espebepe loss rises to PLN 34.9 mln in Q4.</headline>
<dateline>WARSAW 1997-02-05</dateline>
<text>
<p>Espebepe results for the fourth quarter ending December 31, 1996.</p>
<p>(Figures in millions of zlotys unless stated)</p>
<p>						Q4 1996     Q4 1995</p>
<p>    operating loss			 14.95  vs    17.64</p>
